> Inspect the image pyramid and the fixed final samples

All RGB galleries use the same explicit display range[-1,1], nearest enlargement
and no gaps. Display clipping changes PNG values only; model arrays and losses
use signed raw output. The samples are visibly weak after this very small budget.
Twelve random images share no hidden class or target-image conditioning.

