The optional independent NumPy oracle checks all99,309 captured parameter
partials,102 scalar finite differences,800,156 forward values and all288 Adam
writes. It verifies both warm-start groups, cold clocks, every frozen lower
sample, source noise streams, all nine history rows and every inference control.
The native API reproduces all21 original archives/488,107 values and all1,038
instrumented archives/1,890,142 values byte-for-byte. These are migration checks;
the report itself fetches inputs, computes the model and fits through datamunge.

This experiment demonstrates explicit coarse-to-fine optimization and rectangular
fully convolutional reuse. Its fixed small networks and short budget leave weak
images and appreciable training reconstruction error. No independent-image
generalization, realism score or full-paper performance is claimed.

